\li560 How VethuQ uses it: downloads the language model (also used for the OCR models, above).\par\li0
\par
\li360\fi-200\bullet  {\b multilingual-e5-small (intfloat/multilingual-e5-small)} - MIT. Copyright intfloat\par\li0\fi0
\li560 How VethuQ uses it: the language model that reads text in about a hundred languages, Telugu and\par\li0
